<view class="page"
  ><view class="eyebrow">LESS GUESSING, A BETTER SHOPPING LIST</view
  ><view class="heading">少买一点，刚好够吃。</view
  ><view class="muted">按今天待做菜单计算，扣除记录的未过日期库存。</view
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load"
    >{{error}} · 点击重试</view
  ><block wx:if="{{d}}"
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="row"
        ><text class="title">今天的缺料清单</text
        ><text class="pill"
          >{{checked}} / {{d.shopping.length}} 已勾选</text
        ></view
      ><view wx:if="{{!d.shopping.length}}" class="empty"
        >还没有缺料。先选今晚菜单，或检查记录的库存是否够用。<button
          class="button light"
          bindtap="today"
        >
          去选今晚菜单
        </button></view
      ><view
        wx:for="{{d.shopping}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="ingredient row"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="toggle"
        ><view class="check {{item.checked ? 'checked' : ''}}"
          >{{item.checked ? '✓' : ''}}</view
        ><text class="plan-info {{item.checked ? 'checked-text' : ''}}"
          >{{item.name}}</text
        ><text class="quantity"
          >{{item.missing}}<text class="caption"> {{item.unit}}</text></text
        ></view
      ><view class="notice"
        >勾选只记录采购进度，不自动增加库存。实际买到后，请在食材冰箱更新数量；用料增加时会重新提示采购。</view
      ><button class="button outline" bindtap="pantry">
        更新食材冰箱 →
      </button></view
    ></block
  ></view
>
